"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nWe spotted this well-known cafe while passing by and ordered a Long Black.\n\nWe'd gotten quite wet in the rain, so we took a short break to dry off.\n\nHonestly, I'm not sure whether the coffee was exceptionally good, but the timing for a rest was perfect.\n\nIt's a place that takes its equipment seriously, reportedly using the La Marzocco KB90 machine.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"